    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11332" root="خلع" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَاعَةٌ</span></b> : [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلُعَ</span>:] it is <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعَارَةٌ</span> [i. e.
(tropical:)  <i>Vice,</i> or <i>immorality;</i> or <i>vitious,</i> or <i>immoral,
conduct;</i> &amp;c.]; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرَاعَةٌ</span>, a dial. var. thereof;
(S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خرع</span>;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلِيعَةٌ</span></b>  signifies the same.
(TA.)

